<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Happy Birthday Dad</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffecd2, #fcb69f);
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3em;
            color: #b71c1c;
            animation: pop 1.5s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes pop {
            from { transform: scale(1); }
            to { transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 600px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        button {
            padding: 15px 30px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            background: #d32f2f;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #b71c1c;
        }

        .hidden {
            display: none;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 1em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>🎉 Happy Birthday Dad 🎉</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <p>
            Dear Dad,<br><br>
            You are my strength, my inspiration, and my hero.  
            Thank you for all the sacrifices, love, and support you give every day.  
            I’m truly blessed to have you as my father. 💖
        </p>
    </div>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">Click for a Surprise 🎁</button>

    <div id="surprise" class="card hidden">
        <h2>🎂 You Mean the World to Me 🎂</h2>
        <p>
            May your life be filled with happiness, good health, and peace.  
            I promise to make you proud always.  
            <br><br>
            With lots of love,  
            <br><strong>Your Child ❤️</strong>
        </p>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>Made with ❤️ just for you, Dad</p>
    </footer>
</div>

<script>
    function showMessage() {
        document.getElementById("surprise").classList.remove("hidden");
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
